    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Stella Story&quot;</strong> is a simple, exploration-based 2D action game themed around the constellations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll control two main characters:<br><strong>Pisces</strong>, a boy of the Pisces constellation, and<br><strong>Aries</strong>, a girl of the Aries constellation.<br>By switching between them at times, you\u2019ll explore and adventure through the world of the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a world where constellations shine beautifully in the night sky.<br>One day, a great calamity strikes\u2014the <i>light of the stars begins to fade</i>.<br>Sensing the change early, Aries rises to protect the starlit sky she loves so dearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Pisces, a boy caught in the chaos and left without a place to go, meets Aries by chance.<br>Together, the two set out on an adventure across the constellation world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 <strong>Signs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping you on your journey are skills known as \u201c<strong>Signs</strong>.\u201d<br>They\u2019re not only for attacking or healing\u2014you can use them for special movements, gathering enemy info, and more.<br>Just like in a command-based RPG, you select and use them at any time.<br>Collect a wide variety of Signs and customize your loadout to challenge powerful foes in your own style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your guiding constellation might even affect which Signs you can obtain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570080/extras/68b3c61af85fca65236881a0ed54a892.avif?t=1744553116\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Stella Story&quot;</strong> is a simple, exploration-based 2D action game themed around the constellations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll control two main characters:<br><strong>Pisces</strong>, a boy of the Pisces constellation, and<br><strong>Aries</strong>, a girl of the Aries constellation.<br>By switching between them at times, you\u2019ll explore and adventure through the world of the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a world where constellations shine beautifully in the night sky.<br>One day, a great calamity strikes\u2014the <i>light of the stars begins to fade</i>.<br>Sensing the change early, Aries rises to protect the starlit sky she loves so dearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Pisces, a boy caught in the chaos and left without a place to go, meets Aries by chance.<br>Together, the two set out on an adventure across the constellation world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 <strong>Signs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping you on your journey are skills known as \u201c<strong>Signs</strong>.\u201d<br>They\u2019re not only for attacking or healing\u2014you can use them for special movements, gathering enemy info, and more.<br>Just like in a command-based RPG, you select and use them at any time.<br>Collect a wide variety of Signs and customize your loadout to challenge powerful foes in your own style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your guiding constellation might even affect which Signs you can obtain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570080/extras/68b3c61af85fca65236881a0ed54a892.avif?t=1744553116\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A sudden crisis\u2014the stars begin to lose their light. Before the world falls into darkness, a girl named Aries, born under the Aries sign, and a boy named Pisces, born under Pisces, rise to act. This is the story of a world of constellations, where stars are bound together.",
